    Module: Customer Creation & other functionality (US-UCM-01)

    A suite of its own: its TC IDs (SC_01_TC_001 ...) are the same as the Review Car TCs in
    testng-sprint3.xml, and reports group results by TC ID.

    Test data (src/test/resources/config.properties):
      fourWheeler.registrationNumber        - the car whose quotes are listed
      quotes.updatedIdv                     - SC_01_TC_008, when the IDV is typed in
      quotes.noQuotesRegistrationNumber     - SC_01_TC_026, a car no insurer quotes for
    Approved designs (SC_01_TC_033): src/test/resources/approved-design/quotes-listing/
    Tests whose data is missing are SKIPPED.

    Eclipse: right-click this file > Run As > TestNG Suite (needs the TestNG plugin)
    Maven:   mvn test "-Dsuite=testng-sprint3-quotes-listing.xml"
    One TC:  mvn test "-Dtest=SC01_TC001_QuotesFetchedForSelectedVehicleTest" "-Ddevice=android"   (or ios)
-->
